  "description": "The Apailana's Promise, or simply the Promise, was a Braha'tok-class gunship that served the Rebel Alliance during the Galactic Civil War. It bore two X-wings attached to its undercarriage and was crewed by a dozen navy veterans. Three such crew members were Commander Tohna, the second-in-command Sharn and the rebel pilot Nemenov. By 3 ABY, the Promise was serving as escort to the CR90 corvette Thunderstrike, the mobile base of the Alliance's 61st Mobile Infantry, better known as Twilight Company.",
